       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC400.
       AUTHOR.        P. GONZALES.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  06/20/91.
      ****************************************************************
      *  PRODUCT MASTER MAINTENANCE
      *
      *  MODIFICATION LOG
      *  06/20/91 PG         CLONED FROM NWC300
      *  09/30/95 PG   PG95  MOVED TO NORTHWIND FILES (PRDMST)
      *  08/14/98 AW   AW98  CATEGORY NOW IN CODTBL (TYPE CAT)
      *
      *  INDICATORS (WS-IND):  03 EXIT  06 ADD  12 CANCEL
      *    31 SFLDSP  32 SFLDSPCTL  33 SFLCLR  34 SFLEND
      *    40 PROTECT KEY  41 PROTECT ALL  51-66 FIELD IN ERROR
      ****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           CLASS PHONE-CHARS IS "0" THRU "9" " " "(" ")" "-" "." "+".
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DSPFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-NWC400D-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STAT.
           SELECT PRDMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PRDMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS PM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PF-STAT.
           SELECT PRDMSTL1 ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PRDMSTL1
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS PL-KEY
               WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WS-LF-STAT.
           SELECT SUPMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-SUPMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS SM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-SUP-STAT.
           SELECT CODTBL ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CODTBL                      AW98
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED                                  AW98
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM                                    AW98
               RECORD KEY IS CT-KEY                                     AW98
               FILE STATUS IS WS-COD-STAT.                              AW98
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DSPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSP-REC                     PIC X(2000).
       FD  PRDMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY PRDMSTCP.
       FD  PRDMSTL1
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY PRDL1CP.
       FD  SUPMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY SUPMSTCP.
       FD  CODTBL                                                       AW98
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.                                  AW98
           COPY CODTBLCP.                                               AW98
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-X                        PIC 9(3)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DSP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-PF-STAT                  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-LF-STAT                  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ERR                      PIC X     VALUE "N".
       77  WS-SAVE-POS                 PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-MSG-LINE                 PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-DTL-MSG                  PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-KEY                      PIC S9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-HIGH                     PIC S9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TODAY-AREA.
           05  WS-TODAY                PIC 9(6).
           05  WS-TODAY-R REDEFINES WS-TODAY.
               10  WS-T-YY             PIC 99.
               10  WS-T-MM             PIC 99.
               10  WS-T-DD             PIC 99.
       01  WS-MDY                      PIC 9(6)  VALUE ZERO.
      *  INDICATOR AREA FOR THE -SI DISPLAY FILE
       01  WS-IND-AREA.
           05  WS-IND      PIC 1 OCCURS 99 TIMES INDICATOR 1.
       01  SFLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-I OF NWC400D.
       01  SFLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-O OF NWC400D.
       01  SFLCTL-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-I OF NWC400D.
       01  SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-O OF NWC400D.
       01  FMT01-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-FMT01-O OF NWC400D.
       01  DTLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DTLREC-I OF NWC400D.
       01  DTLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DTLREC-O OF NWC400D.
       01  DLTREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DLTREC-I OF NWC400D.
       01  DLTREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DLTREC-O OF NWC400D.
      *  MESSAGES
       01  WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "PRODUCT NOT FOUND".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "PRODUCT CHANGED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "PRODUCT ADDED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "PRODUCT DELETED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "PRODUCT ALREADY ON FILE".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "NO PRODUCTS ON FILE".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "PRODUCT NAME IS REQUIRED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "SUPPLIER NOT ON FILE".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "CATEGORY NOT ON FILE".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "DISCONTINUED MUST BE Y OR N".
       01  WS-MSG-TABLE REDEFINES WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  WS-MSG                  PIC X(40) OCCURS 10 TIMES.
       77  WS-SUP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-COD-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CAT3                     PIC 9(3)  VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN I-O DSPFILE.
           OPEN I-O PRDMST.
           OPEN INPUT PRDMSTL1.
           OPEN INPUT SUPMST CODTBL.
           ACCEPT WS-TODAY FROM DATE.
           COMPUTE WS-MDY = WS-T-MM * 10000 + WS-T-DD * 100 + WS-T-YY.
           MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-IND-AREA.
           INITIALIZE SFLCTL-I-AREA SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT.
       0100-SHOW-LIST.
           MOVE WS-MSG-LINE TO MSGLIN OF FMT01-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM FMT01-O-AREA FORMAT IS "FMT01"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO SFLCTL-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 9000-END-PGM.
           IF WS-IND(06) = B"1"
               PERFORM 4000-ADD THRU 4000-EXIT
               PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT
               GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
           IF C1POS OF SFLCTL-I NOT = WS-SAVE-POS
               PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT
               GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
           PERFORM 2000-OPTIONS THRU 2000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT.
           GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
       9000-END-PGM.
           CLOSE DSPFILE PRDMST PRDMSTL1 SUPMST CODTBL.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  1000 - LOAD THE SUBFILE FROM THE POSITION-TO NAME (MAX 500)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-LOAD-SFL.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(31).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(32).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE C1POS OF SFLCTL-I TO WS-SAVE-POS.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-POS TO C1POS OF SFLCTL-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO PL-KEY.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-POS TO PL-NAME.
           START PRDMSTL1 KEY IS NOT LESS THAN PL-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 1000-DONE.
       1000-READ.
           READ PRDMSTL1 NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 1000-DONE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE SPACE TO S1OPT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE PL-PRD-NO TO S1PRD OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE PL-NAME TO S1NAME OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE PL-PRIC TO S1PRIC OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE PL-STCK TO S1STCK OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE PL-DISC TO S1DISC OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE PL-PRD-NO TO H1KEY OF SFLREC-O.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM SFLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-RRN < 500 GO TO 1000-READ.
       1000-DONE.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(32).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(34).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(31)
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-MSG(6) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  2000 - PROCESS OPTIONS TYPED IN THE SUBFILE
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-OPTIONS.
           READ SUBFILE DSPFILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
               INTO SFLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               AT END GO TO 2000-EXIT.
           MOVE H1KEY OF SFLREC-I TO WS-KEY.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "2"
               PERFORM 3000-CHANGE THRU 3000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "4"
               PERFORM 5000-DELETE THRU 5000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "5"
               PERFORM 6000-DISPLAY THRU 6000-EXIT.
           GO TO 2000-OPTIONS.
       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  3000 - CHANGE.  RECORD STAYS LOCKED WHILE THE SCREEN IS UP
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-CHANGE.
           MOVE WS-KEY TO PM-PRD-NO.
           READ PRDMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           INITIALIZE DTLREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE "CHANGE" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(40).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(41).
           PERFORM 7000-FILE-TO-SCREEN THRU 7000-EXIT.
       3000-SHOW.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW-DETAIL THRU 7500-EXIT.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 8000-EDIT THRU 8000-EXIT.
           IF WS-ERR = "Y" GO TO 3000-SHOW.
      *  READ AGAIN - EDIT MAY HAVE READ OTHER RECORDS OF THIS FILE
           MOVE WS-KEY TO PM-PRD-NO.
           READ PRDMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 7100-SCREEN-TO-FILE THRU 7100-EXIT.
           REWRITE PRDMST-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MSG(2) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       3000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  4000 - ADD
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4000-ADD.
           INITIALIZE DTLREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE "ADD" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(40).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(41).
           PERFORM 4500-NEXT-NUMBER THRU 4500-EXIT.
           ADD 1 TO WS-HIGH GIVING D1PRD OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE "N" TO D1DISC OF DTLREC-O.
       4000-SHOW.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW-DETAIL THRU 7500-EXIT.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           IF D1PRD OF DTLREC-I = ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51)
               MOVE WS-MSG(9) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 4000-SHOW.
      *  DUPLICATE CHECK (A FOUND RECORD IS NOW LOCKED)
           MOVE D1PRD OF DTLREC-I TO PM-PRD-NO.
           READ PRDMST INVALID KEY GO TO 4000-NEW.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51).
           MOVE WS-MSG(5) TO WS-DTL-MSG.
           GO TO 4000-SHOW.
       4000-NEW.
           PERFORM 8000-EDIT THRU 8000-EXIT.
           IF WS-ERR = "Y" GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           INITIALIZE PRDMST-REC.
           MOVE D1PRD OF DTLREC-I TO PM-PRD-NO.
           PERFORM 7100-SCREEN-TO-FILE THRU 7100-EXIT.
           WRITE PRDMST-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(5) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MSG(3) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       4000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  4500 - NEXT NUMBER = HIGHEST ON FILE + 1 (READS WHOLE FILE)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4500-NEXT-NUMBER.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-HIGH.
           MOVE ZERO TO PM-PRD-NO.
           START PRDMST KEY IS NOT LESS THAN PM-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 4500-EXIT.
       4500-READ.
           READ PRDMST NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 4500-EXIT.
           IF PM-PRD-NO > WS-HIGH MOVE PM-PRD-NO TO WS-HIGH.
           GO TO 4500-READ.
       4500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  5000 - DELETE (NO WHERE-USED CHECK)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       5000-DELETE.
           MOVE WS-KEY TO PM-PRD-NO.
           READ PRDMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           INITIALIZE DLTREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE PM-PRD-NO TO D2KEY OF DLTREC-O.
           MOVE PM-NAME TO D2NAME OF DLTREC-O.
           MOVE "N" TO D2CONF OF DLTREC-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM DLTREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "DLTREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO DLTREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "DLTREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-IND(12) = B"1" GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           IF D2CONF OF DLTREC-I NOT = "Y" GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           DELETE PRDMST RECORD INVALID KEY GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MSG(4) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       5000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  6000 - DISPLAY ONLY (STILL READS FOR UPDATE)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       6000-DISPLAY.
           MOVE WS-KEY TO PM-PRD-NO.
           READ PRDMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 6000-EXIT.
           INITIALIZE DTLREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE "DISPLAY" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(40).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(41).
           PERFORM 7000-FILE-TO-SCREEN THRU 7000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW-DETAIL THRU 7500-EXIT.
       6000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  8500 - SUPPLIER AND CATEGORY NAMES FOR THE SCREEN
      *         (CATEGORY 3 BECOMES CODE "003" IN CODTBL)               AW98
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       8500-DESCRIPTIONS.
           MOVE SPACES TO D1SUPN OF DTLREC-O D1CATN OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE D1SUP OF DTLREC-O TO SM-SUP-NO.
           READ SUPMST INVALID KEY GO TO 8500-CAT.
           MOVE SM-NAME TO D1SUPN OF DTLREC-O.
       8500-CAT.
           MOVE "CAT" TO CT-TYPE.                                       AW98
           MOVE D1CATG OF DTLREC-O TO WS-CAT3.                          AW98
           MOVE WS-CAT3 TO CT-CODE.                                     AW98
           READ CODTBL INVALID KEY GO TO 8500-EXIT.                     AW98
           MOVE CT-DESC TO D1CATN OF DTLREC-O.                          AW98
       8500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7000 - FILE TO SCREEN
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7000-FILE-TO-SCREEN.
           MOVE PM-PRD-NO TO D1PRD OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-NAME TO D1NAME OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-SUP-NO TO D1SUP OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-CATG TO D1CATG OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-QPU TO D1QPU OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-PRIC TO D1PRIC OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-STCK TO D1STCK OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-ONOR TO D1ONOR OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-ROLV TO D1ROLV OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE PM-DISC TO D1DISC OF DTLREC-O.
           PERFORM 8500-DESCRIPTIONS THRU 8500-EXIT.
       7000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7100 - SCREEN TO FILE (KEY IS NOT MOVED)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7100-SCREEN-TO-FILE.
           MOVE D1NAME OF DTLREC-I TO PM-NAME.
           MOVE D1SUP OF DTLREC-I TO PM-SUP-NO.
           MOVE D1CATG OF DTLREC-I TO PM-CATG.
           MOVE D1QPU OF DTLREC-I TO PM-QPU.
           MOVE D1PRIC OF DTLREC-I TO PM-PRIC.
           MOVE D1STCK OF DTLREC-I TO PM-STCK.
           MOVE D1ONOR OF DTLREC-I TO PM-ONOR.
           MOVE D1ROLV OF DTLREC-I TO PM-ROLV.
           MOVE D1DISC OF DTLREC-I TO PM-DISC.
       7100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7500 - SHOW THE DETAIL SCREEN AND READ IT BACK
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7500-SHOW-DETAIL.
           MOVE WS-DTL-MSG TO D1MSG OF DTLREC-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM DTLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "DTLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO DTLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "DTLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
      *  KEEP WHAT THE USER TYPED IN CASE WE HAVE TO SHOW IT AGAIN
           MOVE CORRESPONDING DTLREC-I TO DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DTL-MSG.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-X FROM 51 BY 1 UNTIL WS-X > 66
               MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(WS-X)
           END-PERFORM.
       7500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  8000 - EDIT THE SCREEN (STOPS AT THE FIRST ERROR)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       8000-EDIT.
           MOVE "N" TO WS-ERR.
           IF D1NAME OF DTLREC-I = SPACES
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(52)
               MOVE WS-MSG(7) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 8500-DESCRIPTIONS THRU 8500-EXIT.
           IF D1SUP OF DTLREC-I NOT = ZERO
              AND D1SUPN OF DTLREC-O = SPACES
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(53)
               MOVE WS-MSG(8) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
           IF D1CATN OF DTLREC-O = SPACES
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(54)
               MOVE WS-MSG(9) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
           IF D1DISC OF DTLREC-I NOT = "Y"
              AND D1DISC OF DTLREC-I NOT = "N"
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(60)
               MOVE WS-MSG(10) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
       8000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
